ent\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Mike's Mine</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$2,400</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Can play music</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.26.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">July 17th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Sun Dry</b> is a vinyl by \"the3thgod\"\n</p><p><b>Description</b>: \"it is too sunny out here! Put me backkkkk\"\n</p><p><b>Sun Dry</b> is a secret vinyl that can be found by using 2 dynamite on the x located next to the entrance of <a href=\"/wiki/Mike%27s_Mines\" title=\"Mike&#39;s Mines\">Mike's Mines</a>.\n</p><p><b>Sun Dry</b> can be purchased for <b>$2,400</b>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Song\">Song</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e9/Sun_Dry_Oaklands.mp3/revision/latest?cb=20230829115046\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/File:Sun_Dry_Oaklands.mp3\">https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/File:Sun_Dry_Oaklands.mp3</a></audio></span>\n</p><p>note: guys i think this vinyl still exists, why is it classified as “removed” hes not removed\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Location\">Location</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-center show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 278px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/91/Sun_Dry_Location.png/revision/latest?cb=20240912130213\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Sun Dry Location\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/91/Sun_Dry_Location.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/278?cb=20240912130213\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"278\" height=\"244\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Sun Dry Location.png\" data-image-key=\"Sun_Dry_Location.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Sun_Dry_Location.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>This picture is after the cave rework. (It is the same location as before.)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This is second the most expensive vinyl ingame, the first is <a href=\"/wiki/Stud_Vinyl\" title=\"Stud Vinyl\">Stud Vinyl</a>.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"b